## 6. Upload Endpoint Contract (`/api/upload`)

The endpoint must **write to `media.featheredsocial.site`** and return these two response shapes:

### A. Image bundle (FormData: `thumbnail`, `feed`, `original`)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "uploaded": {
    "thumbnail": { "url": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/.../thumb.webp" },
    "feed":      { "url": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/.../feed.webp"  },
    "original":  { "url": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/.../full.webp"  }
  },
  "media_urls": {
    "thumb": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/.../thumb.webp",
    "feed":  "https://media.featheredsocial.site/.../feed.webp"
  }
}
```

### B. Single file (FormData: `file`, `filename`, `type`, `folder`, `timestamp`)

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "url": "https://media.featheredsocial.site/posts/videos/720p/abc.mp4"
}
```

**Folders the frontend sends:**

| Folder | Used for |
|---|---|
| `posts/videos/original` | untouched source video |
| `posts/videos/1080p` | high-quality compressed video |
| `posts/videos/720p` | low-quality compressed video |
| `posts/thumbnails` | WebP video thumbnails |
| `posts` (default) | image bundle (default, bundle keys decide sub-path) |

