    onDismiss={() => setPostUploadState(null)}
  />
)}

// Floating pill (bottom of screen, all views)
{postUploadState && <PostUploadBottomPill uploadState={postUploadState} />}
```

**`PostUploadState`** (from `./components/PostUploadProgress`):

```ts
interface PostUploadState {
  isUploading: boolean;
  progress: number;
  title: string;
  secondaryStatus?: string;
  previewUrl?: string;
  isSuccess: boolean;
  error?: string;
}
```

**Progress milestones:**

| Step | Progress | Title |
|---|---|---|
| Start | 15% | "Uploading your post…" |
| Images preparing | 30% | "Preparing and optimizing photos…" |
| Video preparing | 40% | "Uploading and processing video…" |
| Images completed | 30→85% | "Uploaded photo X of Y…" |
| Publishing | 90% | "Publishing post to your timeline…" |
| Success | 100% | "Post uploaded successfully!" (auto-clears 2.8s) |

*(The old 75% "Attaching reel endpoints…" step is gone with the `/api/reels` block.)*

